From 796a6e1ee2347ce28edae280f7bf62c88e68932f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:15:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] horizon-ctl: type --menu-field ID TEXT [--enter] for mod menu
 text fields; ui lists mod menu buttons and fields

type --menu-field ID types into the textfield ID of the open mod menu as a player does: the field takes the
focus as a press gives it, keeps what its validator allows, and --enter presses Enter, which sends the same
<mod>:menu_text message. ui lists the declared screen's buttons (menu-button-ID, tooltip as label) and text
fields (menu-field-ID) with their bounds, only what a press reaches (an open window's, not those under it).
horizon_mods::screen::controls gives them; docs/horizon-ctl-commands.md regenerated, agent-control.md updated.
Also: the shader_packs test builds Installed with has_settings again (it no longer compiled).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
